3. Field missions completed for IRG region (Aden, Marib, Hadramaut) by the Project Team. Also to Ibb governorate (DFA region).
4. Moore Yemen has completed the third-party monitoring for Q1 2022. The report has been shared for review and approval. 
5. Two Project Board meetings have been completed for IRG region on 22 March 2022 and DFA region on 29 March 2022 respectively.
6. Continuous engagement and coordination with the government counterparts at national, governorate, and district levels; Three monthly coordination meeting took place inviting the five RPs. 
7. ToR for request of information (RFI) for rehabilitation related activities has been initiated and shared with Oversight Support Team for circulation to NGOs/CSOs within UNDP roaster.

